{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rhombus is given with one diagonal twice the length of the other diagonal. \nExpress the side of the rhombus in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> is the area of the rhombus in square inches.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/10144c09954f030634171e7f3196e0f47d347f7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\sqrt{K}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2K}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{3K}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\sqrt{4K}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these are correct}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"682\" height=\"38\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/1/f013e93d921c19a2d6e2d6fdb4e5ad2e82d7f48d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  draw((40,0)--(0,20)--(-40,0)--(0,-20)--(40,0)); draw((-40,0)--(40,0)); draw((0,3)--(3,3)--(3,0)); draw((0,-20)--(0,20)); label(&quot;$\\frac{a}{2}$&quot;,(0,10),W); label(&quot;$a$&quot;,(-15,0),N);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"128\" />\n</p><p>Let one of the diagonals of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rhombus\" title=\"Rhombus\">rhombus</a> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> units long, so the other diagonal is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> units long.  That means the area of the rhombus is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/2/0023013bc445e0622a3a0994f157980b39382f83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 2a \\cdot a = a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"107\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85da8618b904ae541350326f5b5946793001bb7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K = a^2$\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>From the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, one of the side lengths of the rhombus is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/6/726d12571dfd108275e3a55092110cc0e3ac52c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(\\frac{a}{2})^2 + a^2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{5a^2}{4}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5K}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"232\" height=\"45\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>Let the diagonals of the rhombus be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/808d70ce29110acbfa47228747db2e682cf103ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />. Its area is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5ad62a535dfd4d83d8995b23917c06ec1d9af88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=\\frac12(d)(2d)=d^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"158\" height=\"38\" />\nThe diagonals bisect each other at right angles, so a side of the rhombus is the hypotenuse of a right triangle with legs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/0/0e0d629708a6d726e61ab55ad7d34dc4b4632770.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/9/4b98bcf820f7f6e5ba6cbd8351f1d31454b3dea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac d2\\right)^2+d^2}=\\frac{d\\sqrt5}{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5K}}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"275\" height=\"56\" />\nThis is not among choices (A) through (D).\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki